{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"2755","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v3540","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"櫻井しゅしゅしゅ","creatorId":"vndb:s19743","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:2779","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s19743","name":"櫻井しゅしゅしゅ","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:8611","source":"egs"}],"scenario":[{"creditedName":"新堂 舞人","creatorId":"vndb:s52318","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s52318","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s52318","name":"新堂 舞人","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:43736","source":"vndb"}],"music":[{"creditedName":"山本秀樹(斑尾歩、紫賀耕元)","creatorId":"vndb:s2708","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:3138","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2708","name":"山本秀樹(斑尾歩、紫賀耕元)","roleCode":"music","roleLabel":"作品音乐","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:12252","source":"egs"}],"other":[{"creditedName":"k-wandam","creatorId":"vndb:s14880","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s14880","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s14880","name":"小川 敬一","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:43735","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"新堂 舞人","creatorId":"vndb:s52318","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s52318","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s52318","name":"新堂 舞人","roleCode":"director","roleLabel":"导演","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:43737","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c26182","characterName":"バーン","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c26182"},"originalCharacterName":"バーン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"17"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"177"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Race: Unknown"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Zodiac sign: Aries"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Weapon: Sword with fire magic"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Barn was found by Blood collapsed in the Karukia Forest with no memories. Blood gave him the name \"Barn,\" but his true name is unknown. Blood has taken care of him, and now he and Blood have set out to try to recall his memories. He is very energetic, but also a little too innocent and gullible. On his journey, he trains in swordsmanship, and fights with fire magic off of his blade."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Boys' Love Games Headquarters"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c26182"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/25/25d3d5c3a79bc5fbd863ba8e18afc167c8ea0c015348493639b0184f7ee46f61.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/da/dad39afd88d157ec726f7ccdf1b1a36e9e475b618d72481b5267faf913207c16.webp","width":130,"height":150,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"岡田 貴之","creatorId":"vndb:s3357","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3357","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3357","name":"岡田 貴之","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:24078","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c26183","characterName":"ルキナ・ブラッド","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c26183"},"originalCharacterName":"ルキナ・ブラッド","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"187"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Race: Animal people (White tiger)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Blood type: Unknown"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Zodiac sign: Leo"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Age: Unknown"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Weapon: Strength and lightning/earth magic"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Blood is one of the animal people that has the ability to transform from human form to the form of a white tiger (which has given him the nick-name \"Byakko-chan\" among the others). Normally these half-animals stay away from humans, but Blood found Barn abandoned with no memories in Karukia, and feeling tender-hearted toward him, has taken care of him and trying to help him regain his memories. He is a bit serious and overly protective of Barn. When it comes to battle, he uses his brute force, and can affect the ground with lightning punches."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Boys' Love Games Headquarters"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c26183"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/40/403075a639943549e1651095b912f0c1f99ab60bfdb77d1c9f9a6edcd225217a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/74/740bef1465019123f1edb909d6fd88b1cc6c66a7f805d558a3a9c9a43c2e7f9f.webp","width":130,"height":150,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"成田 剣","creatorId":"vndb:s179","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s179","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s179","name":"成田剣","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:24071","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c26184","characterName":"ナッシュ・怜・カサノヴァ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c26184"},"originalCharacterName":"ナッシュ・怜・カサノヴァ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"29"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"180"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Race: Human, unknown heritage"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Zodiac sign: Pisces"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Weapon: Pair of rapier with wind magic"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Nush is the captain of the pirate ship Wing Sword. He is a free spirit, young, wild, and allowing the wind to lead him along in life. When he meets Barn in Melbird, he takes an interest in him and invites he and Blood aboard his ship, to set out on their journey, feeling that fate will lead them. He is a man of manners and elegance, and has a liesurely approach to things. In battle, he uses a pair of rapier, sometimes in conjuction with wind magic on the weapons."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Boys' Love Games Headquarters"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c26184"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5d/5db6a91cbb464f852aeb27d0577d179f12c976321d5179d5ed24ccc37e8f3618.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/08/08818f2dec1e72199e1419fab083e709ea08110b402cd6a0876e7d4134de5008.webp","width":130,"height":150,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"三木 眞一郎","creatorId":"vndb:s252","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s252","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s252","name":"三木 眞一郎","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:24072","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c26185","characterName":"柏木・舜","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c26185"},"originalCharacterName":"柏木・舜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"24"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"179"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Race: Human, European and Chinese heritage"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Zodiac sign: Virgo"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Weapon: Bladed fan and water magic"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Shun is the medic on the Wing Sword. He is an obvious cross-dresser, with his lipstick, pink Chinese dress, and fishnet stalkings, speaking in the feminine language in a feminine tone. But his gracefulness hides his true strength when it comes to battle, as he is proficient in Chinese martial arts with a bladed fan, as well as water-elemental magic. He is friendly to the members of the ship, and in his free time he works on making medicines with herbs."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Boys' Love Games Headquarters"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c26185"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/65/65ca1e96f24f5216c25c7141b22de2725e93c35e2e35c189b2f80768589df5f4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a4/a4c7750db0fecdcc40e88429707b3aec2b21f7ea6dbd94da60406987e306f9a5.webp","width":130,"height":150,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"鈴村 健一","creatorId":"vndb:s90","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s90","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s90","name":"鈴村 健一","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:24070","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c26186","characterName":"聖・Herz・Jr","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c26186"},"originalCharacterName":"聖・Herz・Jr","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"23"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"167"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Race: Human, American/European and Oriental heritage"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Zodiac sign: Capricorn"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Weapon: Frying pan"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hijiri is the cook on the Wing Sword. Though he is 23, he looks more like he is 13, and acts more like a capricious shouta. He is liked by animals, and has two hamsters, Hamlet and Ophelia, one of which is tucked in his shirt and the other that perches on his head. He likes things to be orderly, and is the \"neat freak\" of the ship, and he takes his job of being the cook very seriously. He is very cheerful, but also has a bit of a trouble-maker within him. When he is in battle, he wields the giant frying pan that is strapped to his back with no mercy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Boys' Love Games Headquarters"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c26186"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d8/d84f6e2780e798867cf40e89cac77c7bdc8074996ce86714202bb2d996ff6287.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/06/06e3bc814ba198c0e563ab075976ce4df0d91754141f15757c0ccdbe96157715.webp","width":130,"height":150,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"高城 元気","creatorId":"vndb:s487","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s487","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s487","name":"高城 元気","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:24075","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c26187","characterName":"Ruhe・凪・Streit","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c26187"},"originalCharacterName":"Ruhe・凪・Streit","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"21"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"188"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Race: Human, unknown heritage"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Zodiac sign: Scorpio"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Weapon: Sword"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Nagi is a swordsman on the Wing Sword. He is the main fighter on the ship, weilding a huge sword and at times, an immense, berseker-like destructive power. When Barn first comes aboard the Wing Sword, Nagi helps train him in swordfighting, and he and Blood immediately form a disliking of each other. He is a self-righteous and stubborn person."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Boys' Love Games Headquarters"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c26187"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/af/af9221ae7dc11dfd237f7d02842acd552e809e42fc2103730eb43e4f1678c84f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/26/26fa396ec6d5e3e96931d113ae730289dab5e1064f54976d65e55a7a7bfce8fb.webp","width":130,"height":150,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"檜山 修之","creatorId":"vndb:s391","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s391","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s391","name":"檜山 修之","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:24074","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c26188","characterName":"ルイ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c26188"},"originalCharacterName":"ルイ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"182"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Race: Unknown"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Blood type: Unknown"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Zodiac sign: Unknown"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Age: Unknown"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Weapon: Martial arts"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Rui is a mysterious man who is found floating upon a raft one day and is taken aboard the Wing Sword. He is a smooth-talker and flirtatious to the others aboard the ship. When he fights, he uses martial arts, sometimes wearing his wooden clogs on his hands when he punches. In the evenings, he can be found under the stars playing an oriental instrument. But what is hidden beneath this strange romanticist?"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Boys' Love Games Headquarters"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c26188"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ce/ceab9f720bb7d7ae74f1575659b0bb20bc8ed8990d77a3bd9fe5368ea939a6ed.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4e/4e1dd75ce7bfd1674d8c0d16906c03ed63610d6129d831eb550a1d43638863c7.webp","width":130,"height":150,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"一条 和矢","creatorId":"vndb:s256","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s256","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s256","name":"一条 和矢","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:24073","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c26189","characterName":"PU＾LA.暁龍","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c26189"},"originalCharacterName":"PU＾LA.暁龍","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"29"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Race: Meroid"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Blood type: Unknown"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Zodiac sign: Unknown"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Height: Unknown"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Weapon: Water magic"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Xaoron is the King of Hyoumakai, the underwater kingdom of the Meroid people. He is the protector of the water and can manipulate it at his will. He is one of the Guardians of the Rig Veda legend that tries to stop Barn in his quest. He has a calm tone, but is ruthless in battle."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Boys' Love Games Headquarters"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c26189"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c7/c7c3797ebf541d5cc5e76a81583df641080689d10109e41075f63af3f0d8b3ad.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5c/5c33a582586893342b7eb146892f687f27e84f869bf3c888502d3ad862361c48.webp","width":130,"height":150,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"松田 佑貴","creatorId":"vndb:s5754","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5754","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5754","name":"松田 佑貴","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:24079","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c26190","characterName":"ロゴス・ダリューン","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c26190"},"originalCharacterName":"ロゴス・ダリューン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"37"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"190"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Race: Human, unknown decent"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Zodiac sign: Pisces"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Weapon: Machine gun, fire magic"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Daryuhn is a member of the Embukai, a group of Navy Guards that protect the seas from pirates and other threats. He is the protector of fire and can use its power to enhance the abilities of the multi-bullet gun he carries. He is one of the Guardians of the Rig Veda. He has a fiery temper and is a very sadistic person. Seiyuu: Katsuyuki Konishi."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Boys' Love Games Headquarters"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c26190"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/94/94db19903dedc6fcf444bd16847db23fb1592e36b3c358b116ab1cc8e87e4fb5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5e/5edbb61febe27fecb2d42a09f3fbb606aacc497d12da2ae8b999392d785f1d21.webp","width":130,"height":150,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小西 克幸","creatorId":"vndb:s65","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s65","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s65","name":"小西 克幸","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:24068","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c26191","characterName":"夾・Schwarz","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c26191"},"originalCharacterName":"夾・Schwarz","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"187"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Race: Human, unknown heritage"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Zodiac sign: Sagittarius"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Age: Unknown"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Weapon: Wind magic"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kyo is the captain of the black pirate ship Guardian Crow. He clothes himself in black, and part of his face is obscured by an eyepatch, and he has a black crow perched on his shoulder. Like his outer appearance, his history is also blackened, as he seems to have an unknown relationship with Nush. He is one of the Guardians of the Rig Veda, the protector of wind, and he fights using wind magic."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Boys' Love Games Headquarters"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c26191"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/da/da7b6944e301dfc0d1014d2aa9c88254231e6d2f00c9ce9f714957dfac94d359.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/10/10508238746faa6dff6811bfea3038cef99e15e4b341b07b7cc2ce84b9261799.webp","width":130,"height":150,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"大塚 明夫","creatorId":"vndb:s1085","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1085","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1085","name":"大塚 明夫","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:24076","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c26192","characterName":"ディオ 華花","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c26192"},"originalCharacterName":"ディオ 華花","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"175"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Race: Animal people (monkey)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Blood type: Unknown"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Zodiac sign: Unknown"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Age: Unknown"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Weapon: Earth magic"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dio is the chief of the Juujinkai, the animal people. One of the Guardians of the Rig Veda, he is the protector of earth and fights with earth magic. He is stubborn and non-trusting of humans, but also has a curiosity about them."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Boys' Love Games